Fix fatal error: RdfMappingTest::providerSource() must be static

Drupal core's Drupal\Tests\migrate\Kernel\MigrateSourceTestBase now
declares:

  abstract public static function providerSource(): array;

(a PHPUnit 10+ requirement: methods referenced via #[DataProvider] must be
static). The "rdf" module's own bundled kernel test RdfMappingTest still
overrides this as a non-static method, which is a fatal "Cannot make
static method ... non static" error thrown during PHPUnit's test-suite
discovery (parsing every test class to read its @group annotations),
breaking the entire test run regardless of --group filtering.

The method body doesn't reference $this anywhere, so marking it static
is a pure signature fix with no behavior change.

No newer 3.x release of drupal/rdf exists (3.0.0-beta2 is the latest);
4.0.0 requires drupal/core ^11.3 and is not what's installed here.

--- a/tests/src/Kernel/Plugin/migrate/source/d7/RdfMappingTest.php
+++ b/tests/src/Kernel/Plugin/migrate/source/d7/RdfMappingTest.php
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@ class RdfMappingTest extends MigrateSqlSourceTestBase {
   /**
    * {@inheritdoc}
    */
-  public function providerSource() {
+  public static function providerSource() {
     $tests = [];

